  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The Terra Research Commission is formed of three Felynes, and despite being officially established as the 'Felyne Special Operations Unit,' nevertheless retains its name due to the Scholar's fierce attachment to the 'Commission' title. The group contains a Scholar specializing in ecological research, an Artisan specializing in smithing, and a Palico with a wealth of hunting experience. While acting as a unit they specialize in pushing wooden carts. The Felynes are broadly popular owing to their lovable appearances, and presently undertake work responding to unusual foreign species.",
        "zh": "由三只艾露猫组成的泰拉大陆调查团，虽然正式编制叫做“艾露猫特别行动小组”，但由于学者猫对“调查团”称号的强烈执念而保留了命名。三只艾露猫分别是擅长生态研究的学者猫，擅长锻造的工匠猫，以及拥有丰富狩猎经验的随从艾露猫，作为团队行动时则擅长推动木制板车。艾露猫们因为可爱的外貌而广受欢迎，目前负责特殊外来生物的应对工作。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, these three operators are believed to be uninfected.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0%\nThe three Felynes show no sign of Originium infection.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] Undisclosed\nThe Medical Department has agreed not to disclose the relevant data.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，三位干员体内脏器轮廓清晰，未见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测未见异常，无矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为非矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】0%\n三只艾露猫都没有被源石感染的迹象。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】未公开\n根据医疗部决议，不公开相关数据。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "In recent days, development of the 'Felyne Offroader,' a new model of cart by the Artisan in conjunction with the Rhodes Island Engineering Department, has been formally announced as a success. During its creation, the Artisan exploited a variety of biomaterials native to Terra in ways never before imagined, e.g. using Metal Crab shells to reinforce cart structure, and installing a return-fire cannon that exclusively uses Originium Slugs as shells, leaving the operators of Engineering lost for words. The 'Felyne Offroader' was comprehensively put through its material paces by the Palico himself, being tested for applicability in various possible hunting scenarios including volcano, tundra, desert, and jungle settings, and was ultimately deemed to meet Felyne cart standards, and capable of being used to rescue the Doctor. Meanwhile, the Scholar took into account the 'Felyne Offroader's' development costs, and proposed that a third of its operation expenses be collected from the Doctor for every rescue as compensation, which received the Felynes' unanimous approval.\nOne question raised by an Engineering Operator—'why don't you install an Originium engine, instead of pushing it by hand?'—remains thoroughly unaddressed and forgotten by the Felynes.",
        "zh": "近日，由工匠猫与罗德岛工程部共同研发的新型板车“猫式越野车”正式宣布研制成功。在制作过程中，工匠猫将许多泰拉本土的生物材料以从未设想过的方式利用起来，例如用磐蟹的甲壳来加固板车结构，配置了仅能将源石虫当做炮弹发射的反击炮，令工程部的干员们瞠目结舌。“猫式越野车”的实物由随从艾露猫亲自验收，全方位测试了在火山、雪地、沙漠、丛林等各种可能的狩猎场景中的适用情况，最终确认符合艾露猫的板车标准，可以用于援救博士。而学者猫考虑到“猫式越野车”的研制成本，提议每一次援救都要向博士收取本次行动津贴的三分之一作为报酬，这一点得到了艾露猫们的一致同意。\n至于某位工程部干员提出的“为什么不内置源石引擎，而要手动推车”的疑问，则被艾露猫们完全抛诸脑后了。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    }
  ]
}
